    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/9eeabee7a7a4af9e1b775261109c28d6.avif?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven sci-fi survival-crafting game about mining, base-building, and carving out a future in the ruins of corporate greed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/7e99ab8182d5c2fe61b52dcb9a6d2855.poster.avif?t=1755083110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/7e99ab8182d5c2fe61b52dcb9a6d2855.webm?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/7e99ab8182d5c2fe61b52dcb9a6d2855.mp4?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About AETHUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Maeve</strong> - ex-mining engineer for the <strong><i>Astral Research Corporation</i></strong> (<strong>ARC</strong>), a galactic megacorp that profits by draining entire planets of their resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s left the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARC has not left her, however.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Aethus, ARC claims there is nothing worth having. <strong>Maeve knows they are wrong.</strong> With nothing but her basic mining equipment, tales from her beloved grandpa and her sarcastic AI drone companion,\u00a0<strong>Roland</strong>, she works to build a stable life outside of ARC\u2019s control.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a <strong>dystopian capitalist conspiracy</strong> as you delve through the remnants of <strong>a doomed expedition</strong> and the <strong>abandoned facilities they've left behind</strong>.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/42cdad07f08eb62dd2645512d389df13.webp?t=1755083110\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/d12f30f64ddb0f7d4278e07571657515.poster.avif?t=1755083110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/d12f30f64ddb0f7d4278e07571657515.webm?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/d12f30f64ddb0f7d4278e07571657515.mp4?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and automate your surface mining outpost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the\u00a0<strong>simple but powerful</strong> modular building system to create your own perfectly optimised  base. <strong>Grow plants, raise fish or prospect for gems</strong> in your cozy habitats which you can <strong>decorate with almost any item you come across</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/30e36b90e1752fc56b738cb32e5fe5f4.avif?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/603a0b470b727f21ca64700cde096673.avif?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/1237d310e627b0ff527ef8517531dd67.poster.avif?t=1755083110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/1237d310e627b0ff527ef8517531dd67.webm?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/1237d310e627b0ff527ef8517531dd67.mp4?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser-blast mining in a handcrafted, physics-based alien world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend underground and use lasers, explosives, drills and more to gather <strong>hundreds of types of resources</strong> from your mining claim then <strong>refine them</strong> and <strong>craft new tools</strong> for exploration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/84e5e3ae9b58dad954c8c47dde0105f0.webp?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/51e84226174dc3c48328f3ca36a0a8a6.avif?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/0689eb17f476d82ac574d969e9b82ecc.poster.avif?t=1755083110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/0689eb17f476d82ac574d969e9b82ecc.webm?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/0689eb17f476d82ac574d969e9b82ecc.mp4?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fully voiced narrative about family, resistance and choosing your own future</strong> <br>Built from the ground-up with story at its heart, uncover a dystopian corporate conspiracy and decide how far you\u2019re willing to go for the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story is not an afterthought in AETHUS, there's always narrative to drive you forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/0205da48a5899d725bf68fb9806d8d46.webp?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/01ef538772deed5a5a9eb10b41cf64be.webp?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made with care, not crunch\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No AI content.</strong> No microtransactions. Just one person, one vision, one chance to leave your mark on <i>AETHUS</i>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ce497f3f0da03d13b626754a553e3013.avif?t=1755083110\" data-has-big /></span><i>Pawsmonaut Games is a proud Scottish solo-independent game development studio, </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>founded in 2023 to create deep, compelling experiences without micro-transactions, battle </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>passes or predatory monetisation.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/9eeabee7a7a4af9e1b775261109c28d6.avif?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven sci-fi survival-crafting game about mining, base-building, and carving out a future in the ruins of corporate greed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/7e99ab8182d5c2fe61b52dcb9a6d2855.poster.avif?t=1755083110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/7e99ab8182d5c2fe61b52dcb9a6d2855.webm?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/7e99ab8182d5c2fe61b52dcb9a6d2855.mp4?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About AETHUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Maeve</strong> - ex-mining engineer for the <strong><i>Astral Research Corporation</i></strong> (<strong>ARC</strong>), a galactic megacorp that profits by draining entire planets of their resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s left the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARC has not left her, however.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Aethus, ARC claims there is nothing worth having. <strong>Maeve knows they are wrong.</strong> With nothing but her basic mining equipment, tales from her beloved grandpa and her sarcastic AI drone companion,\u00a0<strong>Roland</strong>, she works to build a stable life outside of ARC\u2019s control.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a <strong>dystopian capitalist conspiracy</strong> as you delve through the remnants of <strong>a doomed expedition</strong> and the <strong>abandoned facilities they've left behind</strong>.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/42cdad07f08eb62dd2645512d389df13.webp?t=1755083110\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/d12f30f64ddb0f7d4278e07571657515.poster.avif?t=1755083110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/d12f30f64ddb0f7d4278e07571657515.webm?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/d12f30f64ddb0f7d4278e07571657515.mp4?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and automate your surface mining outpost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the\u00a0<strong>simple but powerful</strong> modular building system to create your own perfectly optimised  base. <strong>Grow plants, raise fish or prospect for gems</strong> in your cozy habitats which you can <strong>decorate with almost any item you come across</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/30e36b90e1752fc56b738cb32e5fe5f4.avif?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/603a0b470b727f21ca64700cde096673.avif?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/1237d310e627b0ff527ef8517531dd67.poster.avif?t=1755083110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/1237d310e627b0ff527ef8517531dd67.webm?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/1237d310e627b0ff527ef8517531dd67.mp4?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser-blast mining in a handcrafted, physics-based alien world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend underground and use lasers, explosives, drills and more to gather <strong>hundreds of types of resources</strong> from your mining claim then <strong>refine them</strong> and <strong>craft new tools</strong> for exploration.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/84e5e3ae9b58dad954c8c47dde0105f0.webp?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/51e84226174dc3c48328f3ca36a0a8a6.avif?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/0689eb17f476d82ac574d969e9b82ecc.poster.avif?t=1755083110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/0689eb17f476d82ac574d969e9b82ecc.webm?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/0689eb17f476d82ac574d969e9b82ecc.mp4?t=1755083110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fully voiced narrative about family, resistance and choosing your own future</strong> <br>Built from the ground-up with story at its heart, uncover a dystopian corporate conspiracy and decide how far you\u2019re willing to go for the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story is not an afterthought in AETHUS, there's always narrative to drive you forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/0205da48a5899d725bf68fb9806d8d46.webp?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/01ef538772deed5a5a9eb10b41cf64be.webp?t=1755083110\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made with care, not crunch\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No AI content.</strong> No microtransactions. Just one person, one vision, one chance to leave your mark on <i>AETHUS</i>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541530/extras/ce497f3f0da03d13b626754a553e3013.avif?t=1755083110\" data-has-big /></span><i>Pawsmonaut Games is a proud Scottish solo-independent game development studio, </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>founded in 2023 to create deep, compelling experiences without micro-transactions, battle </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>passes or predatory monetisation.</i></p>",
